{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":60888,\"title\":\"Young & Hungry\",\"tagline\":\"Believe in your selfie.\",\"overview\":\"Two worlds collide when Josh, a wealthy young tech entrepreneur, meets Gabi, a feisty young food blogger, looking to be his personal chef. Gabi is desperate for the job and must prove herself, mostly to Josh's aide, who prefers a famous chef for the job. When Josh enlists Gabi to prepare a romantic meal for him and his girlfriend, the dinner goes awry and Gabi finds herself in a very awkward position. With the help of her best friend Sofia and Josh's housekeeper, Gabi turns a difficult situation into an opportunity for employment and maybe even love. Gabi gets some much needed help and advice from Josh’s assistant and his housekeeper.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fh6DbXa5soHPd72dl2I8IJq4uZ0.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pTzgocsWDXy3Td72k3FMZXmTCuc.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":6.7,\"voteCount\":165,\"year\":2014,\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"status\":\"Canceled\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":5,\"totalEpisodes\":71,\"createdBy\":[\"David Holden\"],\"networks\":[\"ABC Family\",\"Freeform\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2018-07-25\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":80307,\"name\":\"Andy Cadiff\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sAZRh0DtGJ0hSDHMvVcel3EJGPA.jpg\"},{\"id\":33490,\"name\":\"Phill Lewis\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8RIWwUZrIoDabtQjMJ5qx3ZOHjE.jpg\"},{\"id\":1212909,\"name\":\"Katy Garretson\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1214817,\"name\":\"Jean Sagal\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/viPGzVM8ooxvsS8bS2K5tZPChfh.jpg\"},{\"id\":15042,\"name\":\"Arlene Sanford\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hsnlV